Is there a way to make aliases for a tiddler title? do you just do that by writing custom text and then still linking it to a tiddler?

!! Current working plan

For now, make a small pointer tiddler under the alternate title that just links to the real one. For example, [[Vitsoe]] says "See [[Vitsœ]]", and [[Absolutism]] says "See [[Universality]]". The pointer tiddler is a real page, so links and searches for the alternate name land somewhere, and you can later fill it in or delete it.
